      "updated": 1783066324002,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O(1) < O(logn) < O(sqrt n) < O(n) < O(n log n ) < O(n^2) < O(n^3) < O(2^n) < O(n!) < O(n^n)",
