      "text": "- Collection is the root , then List ,\n- this are interfaces , from them Arraylist is the class \n- Collections have this have some common methods \n  add , remove , addAll , removeAll , clear , size , isEmpty , \n  contains , containsAll , equals , toArray",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Collection is the root , then List ,\n- this are interfaces , from them Arraylist is the class \n- Collections have this have some common methods \n  add , remove , addAll , removeAll , clear , size , isEmpty , \n  contains , containsAll , equals , toArray",
