      "updated": 1783508868901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bitwise Operator\n\n- use in binary foramat ,\n- if a number is negtive , means the left most bit is 1 , \n  then to calculate its value , first calculate it's 1s compliment then 2s complimetn , \n  then the value of 2s compliment is the value in negative .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bitwise Operator\n\n- use in binary foramat ,\n- if a number is negtive , means the left most bit is 1 , \n  then to calculate its value , first calculate it's 1s compliment then 2s complimetn , \n  then the value of 2s compliment is the value in negative .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
